reference coordinate system as the actual pose based on the roll angle of the pose identification coordinate system relative to the end coordinate system of the operating arm and the pose of the pose identification coordinate system relative to the reference coordinate system, or wherein determining the actual pose of the end of the operating arm comprises:determining a roll angle of a pose identification coordinate system relative to an end coordinate system of the operating arm based on the angle identification and the plurality of pose identifications;

